\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O My Saviour, hear me,
\par Draw me close to Thee;
\par Thou hast paid my ransom,
\par Thou hast died for me:
\par Now by simple faith I claim
\par Pardon through Thy gracious name;
\par Thou my Ark of safety,
\par Let me fly to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O my Saviour, bless me,
\par Bless me, while I pray;
\par Grant Thy grace to help me,
\par Take my fear away:
\par I believe Thy promise, Lord,
\par I will trust Thy holy Word;
\par Thou my soul's Redeemer,
\par Bless me while I pray.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O my Saviour, love me,
\par Make me all Thine own;
\par Leave me not to wander
\par In this world alone:
\par Bless my way with light divine,
\par Let Thy glory round me shine;
\par Thou my Rock, my Refuge,
\par Make me all Thine own.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  O my Saviour, guard me,
\par Keep me evermore;
\par Bless me, love me, guide me,
\par Till my work is o'er:
\par May I then with glad surprise
\par Chant Thy praise beyond the skies;
\par There with Thee, my Saviour,
\par Dwell for evermore.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

